@startuml Level1DFD

skinparam linetype ortho
top to bottom direction

<style>
rectangle {
  BackgroundColor #f0f4ff
  BorderColor #555555
  FontSize 10
}
actor {
  FontSize 10
}
arrow {
  LineColor #333333
  FontSize 9
}
database {
  BackgroundColor #fff8e1
  BorderColor #999999
  FontSize 10
}
</style>

' ── External entities ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
actor    "Player"          as Player
database "Firebase"        as Firebase
database "Local Storage"   as Local

' ── Processes ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
rectangle "P1\nInput Handler"       as P1
rectangle "P2\nFloor Generator"     as P2
rectangle "P3\nGame Loop"           as P3
rectangle "P4\nStats Tracker"       as P4
rectangle "P5\nUI & Transitions"    as P5
rectangle "P6\nLeaderboard Service" as P6
rectangle "P7\nPersistence Manager" as P7

' ── Internal data stores ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
database "DS1\nRun State"    as DS1
database "DS2\nFloor Layout" as DS2

' ── External flows ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Player   -->  P1       : keyboard & mouse input
P3       -->  Player   : game world rendering
P5       -->  Player   : UI screens & audio

Firebase -->  P6       : top 100 leaderboard entries
P6       -->  Firebase : score entry\n(name, score, floors, time)

Local    -->  P7       : stored save data
P7       -->  Local    : updated save data

' ── Internal flows ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
P1  -->  P3  : movement vector, attack trigger
P1  -->  P5  : ESC / menu navigation events

P5  -->  P2  : generate floor (index)
P2  -->  DS2 : room layout (positions, types, adjacency)
DS2 -->  P3  : room graph, enemy spawn data

P3  -->  DS1 : player health, position
P3  -->  P4  : enemy killed, room cleared, time delta
P3  -->  P5  : death trigger, win trigger, floor advance

P4  -->  DS1 : score, elapsed time, kill & room counters
DS1 -->  P5  : run statistics (for display & submission)

P5  -->  P6  : submit score request (name + stats)
P6  -->  P5  : formatted leaderboard entries

P7  -->  P5  : story unlock state, last player name
P5  -->  P7  : new story unlock index, submitted name

@enduml
